            <div style="background:#eab308; color:#0f172a; font-weight:900; padding:15px 40px; border-radius:30px; font-size:1.1rem; text-transform:uppercase; box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(234,179,8,0.3);">Canlı Yayına Bağlan</div>
